  "statement": "\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNorth of the Canadian border, they use the metric system. One hectare (ha) is equal to 10,000 square meters.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSusie\u0027s apple farm in British Columbia is circular is shape, with a radius of 105 meters. Find the area of her farm in hectares.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
  "statementFigure": null,
  "question": null,
  "widgetSlot": null,
  "steps": [
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eFind the area of the circle.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eThe area of a circle with radius 105 is \u003ci\u003eπ\u003c/i\u003e(105\u003csup\u003e2\u003c/sup\u003e).\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eKey in \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20429\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q2nd.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20430\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qpi.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20430\u0026quot;,200)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20431\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qtimes.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20431\u0026quot;,238)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20432\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q1.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20433\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q0.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20434\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q5.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20435\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qxsqr.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20435\u0026quot;,260)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20436\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qenter.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20436\u0026quot;,144)\"\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eThe calculator gives the answer as approximately 34,636 square meters.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-1 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_9_1_areasandvolumes_9b_80/f-80-9b-1.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eConvert to hectares.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20437\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q2nd.gif\"\u003e\u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20438\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qconvert.gif\"\u003e and select \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20439\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q2.gif\"\u003e for Area. Then press \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20440\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q2.gif\"\u003e for m\u003csup\u003e2\u003c/sup\u003e, followed by \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20441\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q9.gif\"\u003e for ha.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-3 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_9_1_areasandvolumes_9b_80/f-80-9b-2.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20442\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qenter.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20442\u0026quot;,144)\"\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20443\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qenter.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20443\u0026quot;,144)\"\u003e. The calculator gives the converted value as approximately 3.46 hectares.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-5 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_9_1_areasandvolumes_9b_80/f-80-9b-3.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
